[{:db/id "93f201c2-2807-52fc-8eb4-d528a5a92114" :answer/id #uuid "93f201c2-2807-52fc-8eb4-d528a5a92114" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "- 8 u \\sin{\\left(v \\right)}" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "d8b8d957-d16d-59c3-b069-322a9e119da0" :answer/id #uuid "d8b8d957-d16d-59c3-b069-322a9e119da0" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "- 8 u^{2} \\sin{\\left(v \\right)} \\cos^{2}{\\left(v \\right)}" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "4b164324-6818-54e6-8c89-068adf9f97cb" :answer/id #uuid "4b164324-6818-54e6-8c89-068adf9f97cb" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "8 u^{2} \\sin{\\left(v \\right)}" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "cb9ed056-0f15-5af6-bf97-d96d493b309a" :answer/id #uuid "cb9ed056-0f15-5af6-bf97-d96d493b309a" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "- 8 u^{2} \\sin^{3}{\\left(v \\right)}" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "132328d8-571d-54c1-a382-e07fe4ab0e8f" :answer/id #uuid "132328d8-571d-54c1-a382-e07fe4ab0e8f" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "- 8 u^{2} \\sin{\\left(v \\right)}" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "b9788c2a-17e2-5bc6-b3b2-10eb15534e45" :answer-field/id #uuid "b9788c2a-17e2-5bc6-b3b2-10eb15534e45" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/choices ["93f201c2-2807-52fc-8eb4-d528a5a92114" "d8b8d957-d16d-59c3-b069-322a9e119da0" "4b164324-6818-54e6-8c89-068adf9f97cb" "cb9ed056-0f15-5af6-bf97-d96d493b309a" "132328d8-571d-54c1-a382-e07fe4ab0e8f"] :answer-field/correct "132328d8-571d-54c1-a382-e07fe4ab0e8f" :db/ensure :answer-field/validate} {:db/id "a098c802-39d1-511b-a349-0ab807ea00b6" :question/id #uuid "a098c802-39d1-511b-a349-0ab807ea00b6" :question/problem "Find the Jacobian determinant of the transformation $T$ that maps the $uvw$-space into the $xyz$-space by means of the equations\n\n$$\nx=4 u \\sin{\\left(v \\right)} \\cos{\\left(w \\right)}\\, y=u \\sin{\\left(v \\right)} \\sin{\\left(w \\right)}\\, z=- 2 u \\cos{\\left(v \\right)}.\n$$" :question/worked-solution "For a transformation \n\n$$\nT:\\begin{bmatrix}u \\\\ v \\\\ w\\end{bmatrix}\\to \\begin{bmatrix}x(u,v,w) \\\\ y(u,v,w) \\\\ z(u,v,w)\\end{bmatrix},\n$$\n\nthe Jacobian determinant of $T,$ denoted $\\frac{∂(x,y,z)}{∂(u,v,w)},$ is given by\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{∂(x,y,z)}{∂(u,v,w)} & =\\begin{vmatrix}\\frac{∂x}{∂u} & \\frac{∂x}{∂v} & \\frac{∂x}{∂w} \\\\ \\frac{∂y}{∂u} & \\frac{∂y}{∂v} & \\frac{∂y}{∂w} \\\\ \\frac{∂z}{∂u} & \\frac{∂z}{∂v} & \\frac{∂z}{∂w}\\end{vmatrix}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFirst, we find the partial derivatives:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{∂x}{∂u} & =4 \\sin{\\left(v \\right)} \\cos{\\left(w \\right)} & \\frac{∂x}{∂v} & =4 u \\cos{\\left(v \\right)} \\cos{\\left(w \\right)} & \\frac{∂x}{∂w} & =- 4 u \\sin{\\left(v \\right)} \\sin{\\left(w \\right)} \\\\ \\frac{∂y}{∂u} & =\\sin{\\left(v \\right)} \\sin{\\left(w \\right)} & \\frac{∂y}{∂v} & =u \\sin{\\left(w \\right)} \\cos{\\left(v \\right)} & \\frac{∂y}{∂w} & =u \\sin{\\left(v \\right)} \\cos{\\left(w \\right)} \\\\ \\frac{∂z}{∂u} & =- 2 \\cos{\\left(v \\right)} & \\frac{∂z}{∂v} & =2 u \\sin{\\left(v \\right)} & \\frac{∂z}{∂w} & =0\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the corresponding Jacobian determinant is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{∂(x,y,z)}{∂(u,v,w)} & =\\begin{vmatrix}4 \\sin{\\left(v \\right)} \\cos{\\left(w \\right)} & 4 u \\cos{\\left(v \\right)} \\cos{\\left(w \\right)} & - 4 u \\sin{\\left(v \\right)} \\sin{\\left(w \\right)} \\\\ \\sin{\\left(v \\right)} \\sin{\\left(w \\right)} & u \\sin{\\left(w \\right)} \\cos{\\left(v \\right)} & u \\sin{\\left(v \\right)} \\cos{\\left(w \\right)} \\\\ - 2 \\cos{\\left(v \\right)} & 2 u \\sin{\\left(v \\right)} & 0\\end{vmatrix} \\\\  & =\\left(- 2 \\cos{\\left(v \\right)}\\right)(-1)^{3+1}\\begin{vmatrix}4 u \\cos{\\left(v \\right)} \\cos{\\left(w \\right)} & - 4 u \\sin{\\left(v \\right)} \\sin{\\left(w \\right)} \\\\ u \\sin{\\left(w \\right)} \\cos{\\left(v \\right)} & u \\sin{\\left(v \\right)} \\cos{\\left(w \\right)}\\end{vmatrix}+\\left(2 u \\sin{\\left(v \\right)}\\right)(-1)^{3+2}\\begin{vmatrix}4 \\sin{\\left(v \\right)} \\cos{\\left(w \\right)} & - 4 u \\sin{\\left(v \\right)} \\sin{\\left(w \\right)} \\\\ \\sin{\\left(v \\right)} \\sin{\\left(w \\right)} & u \\sin{\\left(v \\right)} \\cos{\\left(w \\right)}\\end{vmatrix} \\\\  & =\\left(- 8 u^{2} \\sin{\\left(v \\right)} \\cos^{2}{\\left(v \\right)}\\right)\\left(\\cos^2 w+\\sin^2 w\\right)+\\left(- 8 u^{2} \\sin^{3}{\\left(v \\right)}\\right)\\left(\\cos^2 w+\\sin^2 w\\right) \\\\  & =\\left(- 8 u^{2} \\sin{\\left(v \\right)} \\cos^{2}{\\left(v \\right)}\\right)+\\left(- 8 u^{2} \\sin^{3}{\\left(v \\right)}\\right) \\\\  & =- 8 u^{2} \\sin{\\left(v \\right)}\\left(\\cos^2 v+\\sin^2 v\\right) \\\\  & =- 8 u^{2} \\sin{\\left(v \\right)}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard :question/answer-fields ["b9788c2a-17e2-5bc6-b3b2-10eb15534e45"] :db/ensure :question/validate} {:db/id "eb1933b7-d000-5a91-889e-9974df4f68f8" :answer/id #uuid "eb1933b7-d000-5a91-889e-9974df4f68f8" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "36 u^{2} \\sin{\\left(v \\right)} \\cos^{2}{\\left(v \\right)}" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "d58ab3c0-af56-5de4-ae75-7fd52aa5fe86" :answer/id #uuid "d58ab3c0-af56-5de4-ae75-7fd52aa5fe86" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "36 u \\sin{\\left(v \\right)}" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "0e1688fd-9312-57f7-9c64-e1d3ad42a239" :answer/id #uuid "0e1688fd-9312-57f7-9c64-e1d3ad42a239" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "- 36 u^{2} \\sin{\\left(v \\right)}" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "02cc8b0b-3b33-504e-9fcf-49fefb81af1f" :answer/id #uuid "02cc8b0b-3b33-504e-9fcf-49fefb81af1f" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "36 u^{2} \\sin^{3}{\\left(v \\right)}" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "cbd03066-c83d-5019-9485-37cb3cc2441b" :answer/id #uuid "cbd03066-c83d-5019-9485-37cb3cc2441b" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "36 u^{2} \\sin{\\left(v \\right)}" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "d08d3ad2-917b-5e7d-8e9b-9aa5cfd9d08e" :answer-field/id #uuid "d08d3ad2-917b-5e7d-8e9b-9aa5cfd9d08e" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/choices ["eb1933b7-d000-5a91-889e-9974df4f68f8" "d58ab3c0-af56-5de4-ae75-7fd52aa5fe86" "0e1688fd-9312-57f7-9c64-e1d3ad42a239" "02cc8b0b-3b33-504e-9fcf-49fefb81af1f" "cbd03066-c83d-5019-9485-37cb3cc2441b"] :answer-field/correct "cbd03066-c83d-5019-9485-37cb3cc2441b" :db/ensure :answer-field/validate} {:db/id "a4148d41-ff0c-544e-a801-c54fea1c172d" :question/id #uuid "a4148d41-ff0c-544e-a801-c54fea1c172d" :question/problem "Find the Jacobian determinant of the transformation $T$ that maps the $uvw$-space into the $xyz$-space by means of the equations\n\n$$\nx=3 u \\sin{\\left(v \\right)} \\cos{\\left(w \\right)}\\, y=3 u \\sin{\\left(v \\right)} \\sin{\\left(w \\right)}\\, z=4 u \\cos{\\left(v \\right)}.\n$$" :question/worked-solution "For a transformation \n\n$$\nT:\\begin{bmatrix}u \\\\ v \\\\ w\\end{bmatrix}\\to \\begin{bmatrix}x(u,v,w) \\\\ y(u,v,w) \\\\ z(u,v,w)\\end{bmatrix},\n$$\n\nthe Jacobian determinant of $T,$ denoted $\\frac{∂(x,y,z)}{∂(u,v,w)},$ is given by\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{∂(x,y,z)}{∂(u,v,w)} & =\\begin{vmatrix}\\frac{∂x}{∂u} & \\frac{∂x}{∂v} & \\frac{∂x}{∂w} \\\\ \\frac{∂y}{∂u} & \\frac{∂y}{∂v} & \\frac{∂y}{∂w} \\\\ \\frac{∂z}{∂u} & \\frac{∂z}{∂v} & \\frac{∂z}{∂w}\\end{vmatrix}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFirst, we find the partial derivatives:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{∂x}{∂u} & =3 \\sin{\\left(v \\right)} \\cos{\\left(w \\right)} & \\frac{∂x}{∂v} & =3 u \\cos{\\left(v \\right)} \\cos{\\left(w \\right)} & \\frac{∂x}{∂w} & =- 3 u \\sin{\\left(v \\right)} \\sin{\\left(w \\right)} \\\\ \\frac{∂y}{∂u} & =3 \\sin{\\left(v \\right)} \\sin{\\left(w \\right)} & \\frac{∂y}{∂v} & =3 u \\sin{\\left(w \\right)} \\cos{\\left(v \\right)} & \\frac{∂y}{∂w} & =3 u \\sin{\\left(v \\right)} \\cos{\\left(w \\right)} \\\\ \\frac{∂z}{∂u} & =4 \\cos{\\left(v \\right)} & \\frac{∂z}{∂v} & =- 4 u \\sin{\\left(v \\right)} & \\frac{∂z}{∂w} & =0\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the corresponding Jacobian determinant is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{∂(x,y,z)}{∂(u,v,w)} & =\\begin{vmatrix}3 \\sin{\\left(v \\right)} \\cos{\\left(w \\right)} & 3 u \\cos{\\left(v \\right)} \\cos{\\left(w \\right)} & - 3 u \\sin{\\left(v \\right)} \\sin{\\left(w \\right)} \\\\ 3 \\sin{\\left(v \\right)} \\sin{\\left(w \\right)} & 3 u \\sin{\\left(w \\right)} \\cos{\\left(v \\right)} & 3 u \\sin{\\left(v \\right)} \\cos{\\left(w \\right)} \\\\ 4 \\cos{\\left(v \\right)} & - 4 u \\sin{\\left(v \\right)} & 0\\end{vmatrix} \\\\  & =\\left(4 \\cos{\\left(v \\right)}\\right)(-1)^{3+1}\\begin{vmatrix}3 u \\cos{\\left(v \\right)} \\cos{\\left(w \\right)} & - 3 u \\sin{\\left(v \\right)} \\sin{\\left(w \\right)} \\\\ 3 u \\sin{\\left(w \\right)} \\cos{\\left(v \\right)} & 3 u \\sin{\\left(v \\right)} \\cos{\\left(w \\right)}\\end{vmatrix}+\\left(- 4 u \\sin{\\left(v \\right)}\\right)(-1)^{3+2}\\begin{vmatrix}3 \\sin{\\left(v \\right)} \\cos{\\left(w \\right)} & - 3 u \\sin{\\left(v \\right)} \\sin{\\left(w \\right)} \\\\ 3 \\sin{\\left(v \\right)} \\sin{\\left(w \\right)} & 3 u \\sin{\\left(v \\right)} \\cos{\\left(w \\right)}\\end{vmatrix} \\\\  & =\\left(36 u^{2} \\sin{\\left(v \\right)} \\cos^{2}{\\left(v \\right)}\\right)\\left(\\cos^2 w+\\sin^2 w\\right)+\\left(36 u^{2} \\sin^{3}{\\left(v \\right)}\\right)\\left(\\cos^2 w+\\sin^2 w\\right) \\\\  & =\\left(36 u^{2} \\sin{\\left(v \\right)} \\cos^{2}{\\left(v \\right)}\\right)+\\left(36 u^{2} \\sin^{3}{\\left(v \\right)}\\right) \\\\  & =36 u^{2} \\sin{\\left(v \\right)}\\left(\\cos^2 v+\\sin^2 v\\right) \\\\  & =36 u^{2} \\sin{\\left(v \\right)}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard :question/answer-fields ["d08d3ad2-917b-5e7d-8e9b-9aa5cfd9d08e"] :db/ensure :question/validate} {:db/id "bd61b5ac-cd11-592e-bc2f-458d8703fe2c"