transformation \n\n$$\nT:\\begin{bmatrix}u \\\\ v \\\\ w\\end{bmatrix}\\to \\begin{bmatrix}x(u,v,w) \\\\ y(u,v,w) \\\\ z(u,v,w)\\end{bmatrix},\n$$\n\nthe Jacobian determinant of $T,$ denoted $\\frac{∂(x,y,z)}{∂(u,v,w)},$ is given by\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{∂(x,y,z)}{∂(u,v,w)} & =\\begin{vmatrix}\\frac{∂x}{∂u} & \\frac{∂x}{∂v} & \\frac{∂x}{∂w} \\\\ \\frac{∂y}{∂u} & \\frac{∂y}{∂v} & \\frac{∂y}{∂w} \\\\ \\frac{∂z}{∂u} & \\frac{∂z}{∂v} & \\frac{∂z}{∂w}\\end{vmatrix}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFirst, we find the partial derivatives:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{∂x}{∂u} & =- 2 \\sin{\\left(v \\right)} \\cos{\\left(w \\right)} & \\frac{∂x}{∂v} & =- 2 u \\cos{\\left(v \\right)} \\cos{\\left(w \\right)} & \\frac{∂x}{∂w} & =2 u \\sin{\\left(v \\right)} \\sin{\\left(w \\right)} \\\\ \\frac{∂y}{∂u} & =- 4 \\sin{\\left(v \\right)} \\sin{\\left(w \\right)} & \\frac{∂y}{∂v} & =- 4 u \\sin{\\left(w \\right)} \\cos{\\left(v \\right)} & \\frac{∂y}{∂w} & =- 4 u \\sin{\\left(v \\right)} \\cos{\\left(w \\right)} \\\\ \\frac{∂z}{∂u} & =3 \\cos{\\left(v \\right)} & \\frac{∂z}{∂v} & =- 3 u \\sin{\\left(v \\right)} & \\frac{∂z}{∂w} & =0\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the corresponding Jacobian determinant is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{∂(x,y,z)}{∂(u,v,w)} & =\\begin{vmatrix}- 2 \\sin{\\left(v \\right)} \\cos{\\left(w \\right)} & - 2 u \\cos{\\left(v \\right)} \\cos{\\left(w \\right)} & 2 u \\sin{\\left(v \\right)} \\sin{\\left(w \\right)} \\\\ - 4 \\sin{\\left(v \\right)} \\sin{\\left(w \\right)} & - 4 u \\sin{\\left(w \\right)} \\cos{\\left(v \\right)} & - 4 u \\sin{\\left(v \\right)} \\cos{\\left(w \\right)} \\\\ 3 \\cos{\\left(v \\right)} & - 3 u \\sin{\\left(v \\right)} & 0\\end{vmatrix} \\\\  & =\\left(3 \\cos{\\left(v \\right)}\\right)(-1)^{3+1}\\begin{vmatrix}- 2 u \\cos{\\left(v \\right)} \\cos{\\left(w \\right)} & 2 u \\sin{\\left(v \\right)} \\sin{\\left(w \\right)} \\\\ - 4 u \\sin{\\left(w \\right)} \\cos{\\left(v \\right)} & - 4 u \\sin{\\left(v \\right)} \\cos{\\left(w \\right)}\\end{vmatrix}+\\left(- 3 u \\sin{\\left(v \\right)}\\right)(-1)^{3+2}\\begin{vmatrix}- 2 \\sin{\\left(v \\right)} \\cos{\\left(w \\right)} & 2 u \\sin{\\left(v \\right)} \\sin{\\left(w \\right)} \\\\ - 4 \\sin{\\left(v \\right)} \\sin{\\left(w \\right)} & - 4 u \\sin{\\left(v \\right)} \\cos{\\left(w \\right)}\\end{vmatrix} \\\\  & =\\left(24 u^{2} \\sin{\\left(v \\right)} \\cos^{2}{\\left(v \\right)}\\right)\\left(\\cos^2 w+\\sin^2 w\\right)+\\left(24 u^{2} \\sin^{3}{\\left(v \\right)}\\right)\\left(\\cos^2 w+\\sin^2 w\\right) \\\\  & =\\left(24 u^{2} \\sin{\\left(v \\right)} \\cos^{2}{\\left(v \\right)}\\right)+\\left(24 u^{2} \\sin^{3}{\\left(v \\right)}\\right) \\\\  & =24 u^{2} \\sin{\\left(v \\right)}\\left(\\cos^2 v+\\sin^2 v\\right) \\\\  & =24 u^{2} \\sin{\\left(v \\right)}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard :question/answer-fields ["697c4afa-b74b-58e9-8673-20fb02c283a6"] :db/ensure :question/validate} {:db/id "69d81a15-f9af-5fb0-bf28-29b987a5cbd1" :answer/id #uuid "69d81a15-f9af-5fb0-bf28-29b987a5cbd1" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "- 12 u^{2} \\sin{\\left(v \\right)}" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "5241ee4a-85f2-5f97-b688-cf1417ac8cb3" :answer/id #uuid "5241ee4a-85f2-5f97-b688-cf1417ac8cb3" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "12 u^{2} \\sin^{3}{\\left(v \\right)}" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "00621579-98b8-5fc9-8c16-b5eb82de0221" :answer/id #uuid "00621579-98b8-5fc9-8c16-b5eb82de0221" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "12 u \\sin{\\left(v \\right)}" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "be3bed3d-b68a-5bcb-b8a2-d2d2b35e63ea" :answer/id #uuid "be3bed3d-b68a-5bcb-b8a2-d2d2b35e63ea" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "12 u^{2} \\sin{\\left(v \\right)}" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "05b79517-df53-5b79-ac36-4cbcb1efc025" :answer/id #uuid "05b79517-df53-5b79-ac36-4cbcb1efc025" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "12 u^{2} \\sin{\\left(v \\right)